TraceJVM (Shiklo fork, 2026-10-30): javac's options and its notes. Compiler.setOptions takes javac's options (one per
line: -Xlint:all, -g, -parameters, --enable-preview ...), which go through javac's own Arguments before the compiler
reads them; the compiler had none, so warnings could not be turned on and preview features not tried. After
compiling, the deferred diagnostics are reported, as javac does when it closes: the notes "Note: Main.java uses
unchecked or unsafe operations." were never shown.

